	(text "3.3V LDO from PDB 5V: AMS1117-3.3 (VIN max 15V, dropout ~1.1V, still regulates at 4.4V in).\nLoss = (5 - 3.3) V x ~50 mA = 85 mW. Cin 10uF 25V, Cout 22uF 25V ceramic.\n3V3 pad is an OUTPUT / test point now - do not also feed 3.3V from the FC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.39 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "07b7bae9-7195-4116-a89e-b8f7e7e83da4")
	)
	(text "DRV8320H settings: MODE=GND -> 6x PWM. IDRIVE left Hi-Z on purpose -> 120 mA source / 240 mA sink\n(CSD18532 Qgd 7.9 nC -> ~66 ns rise, ~33 ns fall). VDS = 75k to AGND -> 0.26 V OCP trip\n(~96 A at 2.7 mOhm, ~65 A hot). Dead time fixed 100 ns (H variant)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.96 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3505a14e-70ac-44d5-aed8-1e42e32eaaf6")
	)
